# This repo builds and runs on Linux. Normalize text to LF in the repo and on
# checkout on EVERY platform: a CRLF checkout of patches/*.patch makes the
# Docker build's `git apply` fail with "patch does not apply", and CRLF shell
# scripts break at the shebang.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never convert these.
*.png  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.blue binary
*.gz   binary
*.zip  binary
*.wav  binary
